 ('Which is the first of the five pillars of Islam?', 'The testimony of faith (shahada)', ['Zakat', 'Hajj', 'Fasting'], 'The hadith mentions first the testimony that there is no god but God and that Muhammad is His messenger.', 'First pillar'),
 ('The five pillars are the foundation, not the whole of Islam; ethics and other rulings rise upon it.', 'The hadith’s building image shows the five are the base and the rest of Islam is built upon it.', 'Foundation, not the whole'),
