 ('Ihsan is to worship God as though you see Him; if you do not, He sees you.', 'In the hadith of Gabriel, ihsan is described as worshipping as though seeing God, knowing that He sees you even if you do not see Him.', 'Ihsan'),
 ('In which city was Muhammad born?', 'Mecca', ['Medina', 'Jerusalem', 'Ta’if'], 'Muhammad was born in Mecca in the year known as the Year of the Elephant (Diyanet).', 'Birthplace'),
 ('By what name is the year of Muhammad’s birth known?', 'The Year of the Elephant', ['The Year of Hijra', 'The Year of Joy', 'The Year of Famine'], 'Muhammad was born in 571, the year known as the Year of the Elephant (Diyanet).', 'Year of birth'),
 ('What was the name of Muhammad’s father?', 'Abdullah', ['Abdul-Muttalib', 'Abu Talib', 'Hamza'], 'His father Abdullah died before he was born; his mother was Amina.', 'Father'),
 ('What was the name of Muhammad’s mother?', 'Amina', ['Khadija', 'Fatima', 'Halima'], 'His mother was Amina; Khadija was his first wife.', 'Mother'),
 ('Which title meaning “the trustworthy” was given to Muhammad before prophethood?', 'al-Amin', ['al-Faruq', 'as-Siddiq', 'al-Ghaffar'], 'Because of his honesty in trade and among people he was called “Muhammad al-Amin” (TDV).', 'Title al-Amin'),
 ('Muhammad was known for his honesty even before prophethood.', 'The Meccans called him “al-Amin”, the trustworthy one.', 'Honesty before prophethood'),
 ('Where did the first revelation come to Muhammad?', 'The Cave of Hira', ['The Cave of Thawr', 'Quba Mosque', 'Mount Uhud'], 'The first revelation came in the Cave of Hira near Mecca with the verses beginning “Iqra”.', 'First revelation'),
 ('About how old was Muhammad when the first revelation came?', 'Forty', ['Twenty-five', 'Thirty', 'Fifty'], 'According to Diyanet sources, the first revelation came at about forty in Hira.', 'Age at revelation'),
