 ('In which cave did the Prophet hide with Abu Bakr on the way of the Hijra?', 'The Cave of Thawr', ['The Cave of Hira', 'The Cave of the Seven Sleepers', 'The Cave of Uhud'], 'The two stayed three days in the Cave of Thawr before setting out toward Medina (Diyanet).', 'Cave of Thawr'),
 ('The Hijri calendar takes the Hijra as its starting point.', 'Muslims began counting years from the Prophet’s migration from Mecca to Medina.', 'Hijri calendar'),
