 ('Surat al-‘Asr, al-Kawthar and an-Nasr are short surahs of three verses each.', 'These three surahs have three verses each and are among the shortest in the Quran (TDV).', 'Short surahs'),
 ('The Quran was revealed in Arabic.', 'Yusuf 12:2 states that it was sent down as an Arabic Quran.', 'Language of the Quran'),
