 ('All prophets conveyed the oneness of God.', 'Al-Anbiya 21:25 says every messenger was told: there is no god but Me, so worship Me.', 'Message of all prophets'),
 ('According to the Quran, for what were humans and jinn created?', 'To worship God', ['Only to accumulate wealth', 'To be separated from one another', 'Only to amuse themselves'], 'Adh-Dhariyat 51:56 says God created humans and jinn to worship Him.', 'Purpose of creation'),
 ('According to the Quran, believers are brothers and sisters to one another.', 'Al-Hujurat 49:10: “The believers are but brothers.”', 'Believers are brothers'),
 ('Differences of language, race or tribe do not remove the brotherhood of faith.', 'According to Diyanet, those joined by faith are brothers and sisters; differences of language, race or tribe do not remove this.', 'Brotherhood and race'),
 ('The Prophet said he was sent to perfect good character.', 'The hadith “I was sent only to perfect good character” is in the Muwatta and the Musnad.', 'Perfecting character'),
